{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54280","headline":"偈 · 本寂","name":"偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"学者先须识自宗，莫将真际杂顽空。\n妙明体尽知伤触，力在逢缘不借中。\n出语直教烧不着。\n潜行须与古人同。\n无身有事超歧路，无事无身落始终。\n（《五灯会元》卷十三）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"本寂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54280.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54280","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}